{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o087","title":"征蜀之役于是遂罢","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-2393914b2fbdb7a1fcc7","label":"正文","text":"王肃在太和四年曹真征蜀时上疏论久雨、栈道与转粮之困，本传接称于是遂罢。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-89f5dcffcdf678cf4f6f","zhonghua-q2-0dd6d9b65c9b559d0dff"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0038","role":"征蜀被罢之统帅","evidence":["zhonghua-q-89f5dcffcdf678cf4f6f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"太和四年（公元230）","precision":"year","year":230,"basis":"首轮审定确认的上下文现代释年；承接与逐项对读见审定记录。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2951bd80d7399cb1e15c","zhonghua-q-89f5dcffcdf678cf4f6f"],"chronology":"zhonghua-y-e026b229c203a09b3223","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhonghua-q-2951bd80d7399cb1e15c","basis":"本次上下文现代释年注释直接释年；承接与逐项对读见首轮审定记录。"}},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-89f5dcffcdf678cf4f6f","source_order":[13,374,284],"order":2920}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0038","name":"曹真","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-2951bd80d7399cb1e15c","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-4ef5f4cd2530c4c97b3b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗四年：太和四年（公元 230）。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1f268981f0c0ac72b5a9","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-89f5dcffcdf678cf4f6f","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-3122012a49f0c0175301","layer":"original","quote":"于是遂罢。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":284,"end":289,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q2-0dd6d9b65c9b559d0dff","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-3122012a49f0c0175301","layer":"original","quote":"太和三年，拜散骑常侍。四年〖2〗，大司马曹真征蜀。肃上疏曰：“前志有之：‘千里馈粮，士有饥色；樵苏后爨〖3〗，师不宿饱〖4〗。’此谓平途之行军者也。又况于深入阻险，凿路而前？则其为劳，必相百也〖5〗。今又加之以霖雨，山坂峻滑；众逼而不展，粮悬而难继：实行军者之大忌也！闻曹真发已逾月而行才半谷〖6〗，治道功夫〖7〗，战士悉作。是贼偏得以逸而待劳，乃兵家之所惮也。言之前代，则武王伐纣，出关而复还；论之近事，则武、文征权〖8〗，临江而不济。岂非所谓顺天知时，通于权变者哉？兆民知圣上以水雨艰剧之故，休而息之；后日有衅，乘而用之：则所谓‘悦以犯难〖9〗，民忘其死’者矣。”于是遂罢。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":373,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":289,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
